Responsibilities
Time Commitment & Output
Dedicate 10-12 hours weekly with flexible scheduling;
Participate in two 30-min weekly check-ins about the project;
Produce and manage 10-15 posts per account for 1-2 accounts weekly across YouTube Shorts, TikTok, and Instagram.
Content Development
Source, identify, and clip relevant video content from news outlets, cultural events, and social media platforms;
Craft platform-optimized captions and post copy that authentically represents each account's distinct voice;
